{
  "id": "cotangent-complexes-and-deformations-in-ringed-topoi",
  "title": "Cotangent complexes and deformations in ringed topoi",
  "description": "Homotopical algebra in a ringed topos and the cohomology of diagrams, as foundations for the cotangent complex of morphisms of ringed topoi: homotopy sheaves and the free abelian Whitehead theorem; derived functors of non-additive functors of complexes, the Deligne-Lazard theorem and the shift formulas; décalage, nerves of internal categories and the homotopy type of a category; strict simplicial objects and Deligne's contractibility theorem; derived colimits; fibred topoi, their total topoi, direct images and modules; the cohomology of total topoi and of simplicial topoi, and cohomological descent; the second total topos and local systems; left derived functors of left adjoints; equivariant sheaves on simplicial topoi, the nerves of induced and coinduced modules, and the cohomology of equivariant modules.",
